sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff as Staff on desktop dashboard
  participant Dash as React dashboard
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Graph as LangGraph
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Phone as In-browser phone simulator
  Staff->>Dash: Submit seeded travel request
  Dash->>API: POST /api/cases
  API->>PG: Insert Case + audit
  API->>Graph: Start graph using thread_id = case_id
  API-->>Dash: 201 case_id / RECEIVED
  Graph->>PG: Save offers, evidence and audit events
  Graph->>PG: Save pending approval
  Graph-->>API: Pause at approval interrupt
  loop While the case is active
    Dash->>API: GET case, offers, evidence, events
    Phone->>API: GET case, offers, approval
    API-->>Dash: Current persisted state
    API-->>Phone: Current verified plan and pending approval
  end
  Note over Phone,PG: Both UI views share the same Case ID; only one demo actor, not RBAC
  Phone->>API: POST decision with nonce and state_version
  API->>PG: Transactionally validate and commit approval decision
  API->>Graph: Resume interrupted thread
  Graph->>PG: Upsert idempotent simulated order, then verify
  Graph->>PG: Append completion audit
  API-->>Phone: Decision accepted; poll status
  Dash->>API: GET case / events / orders
  Phone->>API: GET case / orders
  API-->>Dash: DEMO_COMPLETED + trace
  API-->>Phone: Same backend-confirmed mock order
